{"schema_version":"appworld-codex-plan-v1","status":"candidate","failure_reason":"","missing_public_schema_fields":[],"task_id":"2a163ab_3","task_family":"2a163ab","completion_mode":"status_only","plan_summary":"Inspect the required public APIs, authenticate to Phone and Venmo, paginate coworkers and the social feed, derive and review transactions from today or yesterday involving coworkers, like only those transactions, re-read the full feed to verify like-count changes, and complete the action task.","steps":[{"step_index":1,"phase":"inspect","reasoning":"The public documentation for every required task API must be inspected before any task API is called.","action_code":"required_api_docs = {}\nfor app_name, api_name in [\n    (\"supervisor\", \"show_profile\"),\n    (\"supervisor\", \"show_account_passwords\"),\n    (\"phone\", \"get_current_date_and_time\"),\n    (\"phone\", \"login\"),\n    (\"phone\", \"search_contacts\"),\n    (\"venmo\", \"login\"),\n    (\"venmo\", \"show_social_feed\"),\n    (\"venmo\", \"like_transaction\"),\n    (\"supervisor\", \"complete_task\"),\n]:\n    required_api_docs[(app_name, api_name)] = apis.api_docs.show_api_doc(app_name=app_name, api_name=api_name)\nprint({\"documented_apis\": [app + \".\" + api for app, api in required_api_docs]})","depends_on_steps":[],"api_names_used":["api_docs.show_api_doc"],"mutates_state":false,"verification_targets":["Public documentation is retrieved for every required task API."],"output_policy":"safe_aggregate"},{"step_index":2,"phase":"authenticate","reasoning":"With the API contracts inspected, retrieve the supervisor profile and account credentials needed for app authentication while keeping passwords private.","action_code":"supervisor_profile = apis.supervisor.show_profile()\naccount_password_records = apis.supervisor.show_account_passwords()","depends_on_steps":[1],"api_names_used":["supervisor.show_profile","supervisor.show_account_passwords"],"mutates_state":false,"verification_targets":["Supervisor profile and credential records are saved without printing passwords."],"output_policy":"no_print"},{"step_index":3,"phase":"authenticate","reasoning":"The profile and credential records can now be used to authenticate to Phone, obtain the authoritative current date, and paginate all contacts classified as coworkers.","action_code":"phone_password = next(record[\"password\"] for record in account_password_records if record[\"account_name\"].strip().casefold() == \"phone\")\nphone_login_result = apis.phone.login(username=supervisor_profile[\"phone_number\"], password=phone_password)\nphone_access_token = phone_login_result[\"access_token\"]\nphone_now = apis.phone.get_current_date_and_time()\ncoworker_contacts = []\ncontacts_page_index = 0\nwhile True:\n    contacts_page = apis.phone.search_contacts(access_token=phone_access_token, query=\"\", relationship=\"coworker\", page_index=contacts_page_index, page_limit=20)\n    coworker_contacts.extend(contacts_page)\n    if len(contacts_page) < 20:\n        break\n    contacts_page_index += 1\nprint({\"phone_date\": phone_now[\"date\"], \"coworker_contact_count\": len(coworker_contacts), \"contact_pages_read\": contacts_page_index + 1})","depends_on_steps":[1,2],"api_names_used":["phone.login","phone.get_current_date_and_time","phone.search_contacts"],"mutates_state":false,"verification_targets":["Phone authentication succeeds.","The authoritative current date is saved.","Every page of coworker contacts is read."],"output_policy":"safe_aggregate"},{"step_index":4,"phase":"derive","reasoning":"The current date and complete coworker contact set are available, so derive yesterday without external libraries and normalize coworker email identities for exact feed matching.","action_code":"current_date = phone_now[\"date\"][:10]\nyear, month, day = [int(part) for part in current_date.split(\"-\")]\nmonth_lengths = [31, 29 if (year % 400 == 0 or (year % 4 == 0 and year % 100 != 0)) else 28, 31, 30, 31, 30, 31, 31, 30, 31, 30, 31]\nif day > 1:\n    previous_year, previous_month, previous_day = year, month, day - 1\nelif month > 1:\n    previous_year, previous_month = year, month - 1\n    previous_day = month_lengths[previous_month - 1]\nelse:\n    previous_year, previous_month, previous_day = year - 1, 12, 31\nyesterday_date = f\"{previous_year:04d}-{previous_month:02d}-{previous_day:02d}\"\ntarget_dates = {current_date, yesterday_date}\ncoworker_emails = {contact[\"email\"].strip().casefold() for contact in coworker_contacts if contact.get(\"email\")}\nprint({\"target_dates\": sorted(target_dates), \"coworker_identity_count\": len(coworker_emails)})","depends_on_steps":[3],"api_names_used":[],"mutates_state":false,"verification_targets":["Today and yesterday are derived from the Phone date.","Coworker identities are normalized from the fully paginated contact results."],"output_policy":"safe_aggregate"},{"step_index":5,"phase":"authenticate","reasoning":"The Venmo credential can be selected from the saved private credential records, after which the entire social feed must be paginated before selecting transactions.","action_code":"venmo_password = next(record[\"password\"] for record in account_password_records if record[\"account_name\"].strip().casefold() == \"venmo\")\nvenmo_login_result = apis.venmo.login(username=supervisor_profile[\"email\"], password=venmo_password)\nvenmo_access_token = venmo_login_result[\"access_token\"]\nsocial_feed = []\nfeed_page_index = 0\nwhile True:\n    feed_page = apis.venmo.show_social_feed(access_token=venmo_access_token, page_index=feed_page_index, page_limit=20)\n    social_feed.extend(feed_page)\n    if len(feed_page) < 20:\n        break\n    feed_page_index += 1\nprint({\"feed_record_count\": len(social_feed), \"feed_pages_read\": feed_page_index + 1})","depends_on_steps":[1,2,4],"api_names_used":["venmo.login","venmo.show_social_feed"],"mutates_state":false,"verification_targets":["Venmo authentication succeeds.","Every page of the social feed is read."],"output_policy":"safe_aggregate"},{"step_index":6,"phase":"derive","reasoning":"The complete feed, target dates, and coworker identities are now available, so select transactions whose creation date is in scope and whose sender or receiver email matches a coworker.","action_code":"target_transactions = []\nfor transaction in social_feed:\n    transaction_date = transaction[\"created_at\"][:10]\n    sender_email = transaction[\"sender\"][\"email\"].strip().casefold()\n    receiver_email = transaction[\"receiver\"][\"email\"].strip().casefold()\n    if transaction_date in target_dates and (sender_email in coworker_emails or receiver_email in coworker_emails):\n        target_transactions.append(transaction)\ntarget_transaction_ids = [transaction[\"transaction_id\"] for transaction in target_transactions]\nbaseline_like_counts = {transaction[\"transaction_id\"]: transaction[\"like_count\"] for transaction in target_transactions}\ncandidate_summaries = [{\"transaction_id\": transaction[\"transaction_id\"], \"created_at\": transaction[\"created_at\"], \"sender\": transaction[\"sender\"][\"name\"], \"receiver\": transaction[\"receiver\"][\"name\"], \"like_count\": transaction[\"like_count\"]} for transaction in target_transactions]\nprint(candidate_summaries)","depends_on_steps":[4,5],"api_names_used":[],"mutates_state":false,"verification_targets":["Candidate IDs come only from real feed records.","Each candidate is dated today or yesterday and involves a coworker identity.","Baseline like counts are saved for later verification."],"output_policy":"public_records"},{"step_index":7,"phase":"derive","reasoning":"Before changing Venmo state, separately review and deduplicate the observed candidate selection and confirm its predicates from the saved public records.","action_code":"reviewed_target_transactions = [transaction for transaction in target_transactions if transaction[\"created_at\"][:10] in target_dates and (transaction[\"sender\"][\"email\"].strip().casefold() in coworker_emails or transaction[\"receiver\"][\"email\"].strip().casefold() in coworker_emails)]\nreviewed_target_ids = sorted({transaction[\"transaction_id\"] for transaction in reviewed_target_transactions})\nselection_review = {\n    \"observed_candidate_count\": len(target_transaction_ids),\n    \"unique_reviewed_target_count\": len(reviewed_target_ids),\n    \"all_reviewed_ids_have_baselines\": all(transaction_id in baseline_like_counts for transaction_id in reviewed_target_ids),\n    \"all_reviewed_dates_match\": all(transaction[\"created_at\"][:10] in target_dates for transaction in reviewed_target_transactions),\n    \"all_reviewed_parties_match\": all(transaction[\"sender\"][\"email\"].strip().casefold() in coworker_emails or transaction[\"receiver\"][\"email\"].strip().casefold() in coworker_emails for transaction in reviewed_target_transactions),\n}\nprint(selection_review)","depends_on_steps":[6],"api_names_used":[],"mutates_state":false,"verification_targets":["The mutation list is deduplicated.","Every reviewed target still satisfies the date and coworker predicates.","Every reviewed target has a saved baseline like count."],"output_policy":"safe_aggregate"},{"step_index":8,"phase":"act","reasoning":"The mutation IDs have been derived, observed, and separately reviewed, so like exactly those reviewed transactions and retain each public API result.","action_code":"like_results = {}\nfor transaction_id in reviewed_target_ids:\n    like_results[transaction_id] = apis.venmo.like_transaction(transaction_id=transaction_id, access_token=venmo_access_token)\nprint({\"like_requests_made\": len(like_results)})","depends_on_steps":[7],"api_names_used":["venmo.like_transaction"],"mutates_state":true,"verification_targets":["A like request is made once for every reviewed target ID and for no other ID."],"output_policy":"safe_aggregate"},{"step_index":9,"phase":"verify","reasoning":"After the like operations, re-read every social-feed page and compare each reviewed target's current like count with its saved baseline before completion.","action_code":"verified_social_feed = []\nverification_page_index = 0\nwhile True:\n    verification_page = apis.venmo.show_social_feed(access_token=venmo_access_token, page_index=verification_page_index, page_limit=20)\n    verified_social_feed.extend(verification_page)\n    if len(verification_page) < 20:\n        break\n    verification_page_index += 1\nverified_feed_by_id = {transaction[\"transaction_id\"]: transaction for transaction in verified_social_feed}\nverification_details = {\n    transaction_id: {\n        \"present_after_mutation\": transaction_id in verified_feed_by_id,\n        \"baseline_like_count\": baseline_like_counts[transaction_id],\n        \"current_like_count\": verified_feed_by_id[transaction_id][\"like_count\"] if transaction_id in verified_feed_by_id else None,\n        \"like_count_increased\": transaction_id in verified_feed_by_id and verified_feed_by_id[transaction_id][\"like_count\"] >= baseline_like_counts[transaction_id] + 1,\n    }\n    for transaction_id in reviewed_target_ids\n}\nverification_ok = all(detail[\"present_after_mutation\"] and detail[\"like_count_increased\"] for detail in verification_details.values())\nprint({\"verification_ok\": verification_ok, \"verified_target_count\": len(verification_details), \"verification_pages_read\": verification_page_index + 1, \"targets\": verification_details})","depends_on_steps":[8],"api_names_used":["venmo.show_social_feed"],"mutates_state":false,"verification_targets":["Every page of the post-mutation social feed is read.","Every reviewed target remains present.","Each reviewed target's like count is at least one greater than its saved baseline."],"output_policy":"safe_aggregate"},{"step_index":10,"phase":"complete","reasoning":"The requested action has been performed and its post-mutation verification data has been captured, so finalize this action task with success and no answer payload.","action_code":"completion_result = apis.supervisor.complete_task(status=\"success\")","depends_on_steps":[9],"api_names_used":["supervisor.complete_task"],"mutates_state":true,"verification_targets":["The action task is marked complete with success and without a QA answer."],"output_policy":"no_print"}]}